                                    <desc>Beautiful handwriting. According to <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/N6HPGQK3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de l’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei: Fonds Conti Rossini et Fonds Caetani 209, 375, 376, 377, 378</title><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei</publisher><date>1976</date><series><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="item">84, I</citedRange><citedRange unit="page">217</citedRange><citedRange unit="note">2</citedRange></bibl>, the name of the copier of the text or of the copier of the Vorlage is 
                                        <persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15536TanseaKr">Tanśǝʾa Krǝstos</persName>, who is probably mentioned  
                                        on <locus target="#13v"/> (indicated as ‘31v’ by Stefan Strelcyn, what is likely to be incorrect, because the 
                                        codicological unit ranges from <locus from="1" to="19"/> and the text ends in <locus target="#13v"/>).</desc>
                                    <seg type="ink">European ink, black and red.</seg>
                                </handNote>
                            </handDesc>
                            <additions>
                                <list>
                                    <item xml:id="a1">
                                        <locus target="#14r"/>
                                        <desc type="GuestText">
                                            A <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6591MonGenealogy">genealogy of Ethiopian monks</ref> said to descend from
                                            Egyptian predecessors, written in ten lines.</desc>
                                        <q xml:lang="gez">እንጦንዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለመቃር<add place="below">ዮ</add>ስ፤ ወመቃርዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለጳላምን፤ ወጳላምን፡ ወለዶ፡ 
                                            ለአርሳንዮስ፤ ወአርሳንዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለአኖሬዮስ፤ ወአ<add place="below">ኖ</add>ሬዮስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለጳኵሚስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለአርጋዊ፤ ወአረጋዊ፡ 
                                            ወለዶ፡ ለተክለ፡ ሀይማኖት፤ ወተክለ፡ ሀይማኖት፡ ወለዶ፡ ለመድኃኒነ፡ እግዚእ፤ ወመድኃኒነ፡ እግዚእ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለሳሙኤል፡ ዘቆየጻ፤ ወሳሙኤል፡ ዘቆየጻ፡ 
                                            ወለዶ፡ ለገብረ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ዘሰሎዳ፤ ወገብረ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለእንድርያስ፡ ዘፂዳርዋ፤ ወእንድርያስ፡ ወለዶ፡ ለዘካርያስ፡ ወለያሬድ፡ ወለዮሐንስ። 
                                            <gap reason="ellipsis"/></q>
                                    </item>
