                                <msItem xml:id="p2_i1.3">
                                    <locus from="33v" to="35v"/>
                                    <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1482GadlaM#Malke">Gadla Mātyās za-ʿAddǝqe:  Malke</title>
                                    <note>Written in continuo in the manuscript.</note>
                                    <incipit xml:lang="gez">እመ፡ ጠቢባን፡ ጥበብ፡ እምባሕርየ፡ ጥበብ፡ ዘተወልድኪ። እድግተ፡ በለዓም፡ ቅድመ፡ በከመ፡ አንበብኪ። እስመ፡ በትግሕ፡ 
                                        ወጠንኩ፡ ድርሳነ፡ ማትያስ፡ ገብርኪ። እንዘ፡ ትሠውጢ፡ በላዕሌየ፡ መንፈሰ፡ ዚአኪ። አንብብኒ፡ አንብብኒ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied>
                                        ለበሀም፡ ገብርኪ። ሰላም፡ ለጽንሰትከ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ በሥምረቱ። ወለልደትከ፡ ፀሐይ፡ ዘእምሰማየ፡ አዳም፡ ስርቀቱ። አምኃ፡ ማኅሌት፡ አሀብከ፡ እመዝገበ፡ 
                                        ልብየ፡ ዝንቱ። ሀበኒ፡ ልብ፡ ጥበብ፡ ለዘውገ፡ እንስሳ፡ ስርአቱ። ማትያስ፡ ውሂብ፡ እምረኪብ፡ ውእቱ።</incipit>
                                </msItem>
                                <colophon xml:id="coloph1"><locus target="#35v"/>
                                    According to the colophon, the manuscript was written in <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC1169AddiLa">ʿAddi Lamza</placeName> by the priest 
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15521FessehaSey">Fǝśśeḥa Ṣǝyon Habta ʾAb</persName>,
                                    <date when="1914-02-04">4 February 1914</date> during the reign of
                                    <persName ref="https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q150642"><roleName type="office">King</roleName> Emmanuel III</persName> and 
                                    under the command of <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15532Teodorani">
                                        <roleName type="rank">Commissario Commendatore</roleName> Teodorani</persName> and 
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15533Caderni"><roleName type="rank">Cavaliere</roleName> 
                                        <roleName type="function">avvocato</roleName> Caderni</persName>. The date is wrongly indicated with
